# Helm charts

Scaffold a new chart with:

```bash
helm create helm_charts/<name>
```

Then change the scaffold to this repo’s use case and delete unused default resources.

External routing uses Gateway API (`HTTPRoute`, `BackendPolicy`). Legacy GCE Ingress is only when `enable_legacy_ingress` is set.

Wire the chart in Terraform: values local in `deploy/helm-values.tf`, `helm_release` in `deploy/helm.tf` merged with `local.common_helm_values`, image fields on `var.helm_config` in root `variables.tf` and `environments/sample.tfvars`.

`local.common_helm_values` in `deploy/locals.tf` is:

```hcl
global = {
  cloudProvider = "gcp"
  namespace     = local.namespace_name
  gateway = {
    name             = local.gateway_name
    namespace        = local.namespace_name
    gatewayClassName = "gke-l7-regional-external-managed"
  }
  backendPolicy = {
    enabled        = true
    securityPolicy = data.terraform_remote_state.infra.outputs.security_policy_name
  }
  httpRoute = {
    enabled = true
  }
}
```
